[1m[38;5;231mWhich tooling should I set up from the start?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Linting + auto-formatting
  [38;5;246mBiome (single tool, zero-config, fast) for lint and format. Recommended.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Unit test infrastructure
  [38;5;246mNode's built-in test runner, no dependency. Test layout plus a first passing test for dueState. Recommended.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] End-to-end tests
  [38;5;246mPlaywright against the real page. Real signal for UI, but heavy for a single static page with no network or auth.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Mutation testing
  [38;5;246mVerifies the tests actually catch bugs. Useful once due-state.js is stable; premature before code exists.[39m
